                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female supervillain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "655f95b7-3b6f-4ddc-888c-6606cdcbfef8",
                                                "sense_id": "b9fe2a30-f207-3ec4-9898-5389f69b35ee",
                                                "text": "On the everlasting As the World Turns, Lisa was another kind of person, a sort of supervillainess of the soaps. Yet she was always saved from damnation..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ce126a9-5c8e-4a1d-9af9-cd2a5338cec0",
                                                "sense_id": "b9fe2a30-f207-3ec4-9898-5389f69b35ee",
                                                "text": "Disappointingly, Valkyrie turns out really to be the Enchantress, a supervillainess whose intention is the destruction of both sexes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ab9ec41-7b86-47e4-b8f3-00100ba00f9b",
                                                "sense_id": "b9fe2a30-f207-3ec4-9898-5389f69b35ee",
                                                "text": "Created by DC Comics and featured in Batman, supervillainess Poison Ivy is a potent femme fatale."
                                            }
